{"4875950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GREY FRONTIER", "steam_appid": 4875950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6a31fc1fd7f415c833bc88ed74f314f.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/2e760e38a6d7a86c64abdd20d88c0b07.poster.avif?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/2e760e38a6d7a86c64abdd20d88c0b07.webm?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/2e760e38a6d7a86c64abdd20d88c0b07.mp4?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/82f84782a17bce08b593bdf0eac60d0c.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span><strong>Grey Frontier</strong> is an atmospheric adventure game with elements of exploration and mystery, set in an alternate version of the Soviet countryside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6a31fc1fd7f415c833bc88ed74f314f.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/682ce25a05e8c688bee4b7209f630889.poster.avif?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/682ce25a05e8c688bee4b7209f630889.webm?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/682ce25a05e8c688bee4b7209f630889.mp4?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/82f84782a17bce08b593bdf0eac60d0c.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Following a mysterious catastrophe, the world has changed. Communication with the Ilyinsk Region has been lost, and everyone sent there has vanished without a trace. In response, the authorities dispatch a Vympel special forces unit led by Vladimir Molotov to investigate the incident. However, the mission goes terribly wrong, and Vladimir soon finds himself alone on the border of the Grey Zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6a31fc1fd7f415c833bc88ed74f314f.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/ae9a75fee61d247031c7656d290ab612.poster.avif?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/ae9a75fee61d247031c7656d290ab612.webm?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/ae9a75fee61d247031c7656d290ab612.mp4?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/82f84782a17bce08b593bdf0eac60d0c.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span>Explore abandoned villages, dams, logging sites, and secret facilities behind the wheel of your old Niva. Gather resources, uncover the fate of missing expeditions, and slowly piece together the truth behind the disaster that transformed the region forever.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6a31fc1fd7f415c833bc88ed74f314f.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6eacf0fa07f50ff369dc5ecfe02ede9.poster.avif?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6eacf0fa07f50ff369dc5ecfe02ede9.webm?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6eacf0fa07f50ff369dc5ecfe02ede9.mp4?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/82f84782a17bce08b593bdf0eac60d0c.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span>But be careful. The Grey Zone hides far more than mere anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/f6a31fc1fd7f415c833bc88ed74f314f.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/9208065932523f580c739e72b66fb301.poster.avif?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/9208065932523f580c739e72b66fb301.webm?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/9208065932523f580c739e72b66fb301.mp4?t=1782504261\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4875950/extras/82f84782a17bce08b593bdf0eac60d0c.webp?t=1782504261\" width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Explore diverse regions using your vehicle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Immerse yourself in a Soviet provincial atmosphere inspired by Slavic folklore and urban legends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Encounter dangerous anomalies that alter the rules of exploration and travel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Discover abandoned villages, laboratories, bunkers, and other mysterious locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Upgrade your vehicle and prepare for increasingly dangerous expeditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">• Uncover a story about lost expeditions, forgotten secrets, and the consequences of a failed experiment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every journey beyond the safety of your shelter may be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you uncover the truth behind the Grey Zone?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat